# Sky and fog with the observer's height (plPosY) from WorldView::bbox().
# Four viewpoints of streaming-shots at noon and at 20:00 (sun ~18 degrees up).
# Run on one host: main and the fix with streaming, and OPENGOTHIC_STREAMING=0 as the reference.
seed 73013
deterministic on
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
watch player
set time 12 0
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
freeze PAL_203_LOTHAR
cam look 120
cam world 700 280 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot market-12
wait 34
goto pos 5391 320 -5822
cam look 120
cam world 850 300 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot harbour-12
wait 34
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_16
cam look 150
cam world 500 230 0
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot forest-12
wait 34
goto pos 30000 4000 -12000
cam look 120
cam world 42000 6500 138.5
wait 10000
cam hold
streaming wait
shot island-12
wait 34
